    wordread context, fix round 3: a pair's target is the part of Terra's string inside our box (characters spread evenly along the word's rectangle, each inside by the share of its ink px in our box, a space by its area; the likelihood the expectation over the contiguous runs they make; a word wholly inside keeps its whole string); scores take the expected part; the block analysis on whole-word pairs
    
    Held out (weighted): joint kept (pooled NLL 2.06 against 2.11; 1.01 with T 3.90-3.95); tau sequential 0.75-0.81, joint
    0.65-0.69; joint w code 9.1-14.5 / block 2.0-3.0 / street 1.2-1.3. The brief's example passes in all 796 held-out code
    boxes in both modes; off-list ink with the stronger read kept 50% (joint) against 55% (sequential) by weight.
    
