Date:   Tue Nov 17 10:09:38 2026 -0800

    wordread context: a code's mass goes to its forms by their measured P(form | code) (text-crops prior.json form_weights, learned on the training labels), kept in the pack; the fit keeps the read words, refit recomputes the priors from the pack without reading; the log-likelihood's profiles in w and e
    
    Refit on the kept ink: w 4.03 / 4.89 / 5.90 / 5.17 (nw ne sw se), e at its floor (nw, se) or 0.0025-0.0026 (ne, sw);
    each fold's log-likelihood rises 4-20 nats over the flat split.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UjTgrnx2j4PhzZErrad25Q
